                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac7e017b-28a8-3708-a965-7deaf226c073",
                        "entry_id": "d041d24b-c516-3316-85af-c44f6e1ce051",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A spiteful and violent person, especially a woman."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1553f915-9fa3-3d99-9bc7-eae64baada46",
                        "entry_id": "d041d24b-c516-3316-85af-c44f6e1ce051",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A demonic cat of hell."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45ff1aa4-a6ac-4ca3-a613-ee004ff06ab9",
                                "sense_id": "1553f915-9fa3-3d99-9bc7-eae64baada46",
                                "text": "The hellfire abilities were reserved for special kinds of demons. Hellcats, demon princes, and—you guessed it—hellhounds. / Of the three, Vanessa would prefer to not deal with the hellhounds. Unlike hellcats and demon princes, they had the worst attitude, and they usually traveled in small groupings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9aaabe2c-f442-45fe-bd08-21f0206890d1",
                                "sense_id": "1553f915-9fa3-3d99-9bc7-eae64baada46",
                                "text": "The Scourge was still a new concept to Logan, but hey, hellhounds and hellcats had to come from somewhere. / “Okay, so what does the ritual entail?” Esme asked. “If you need stuff for it, I’ve probably got it.” / “We’re going to need a Seal of Solomon drawn in blood,” Ceri said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "95855eec-6371-4900-83ac-185df4e24907",
                                "sense_id": "1553f915-9fa3-3d99-9bc7-eae64baada46",
                                "text": "“These hellcats…they’re not the cute, fluffy kind that Caim and Seth played fetch with. They’e bigger and louder. Like dragons with lion heads.” / That was the second mention of hellcats that looked like lions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb5792e9-2e20-4f76-9ca3-2bf0d3881e19",
                        "source_entry_id": "d041d24b-c516-3316-85af-c44f6e1ce051",
                        "source_sense_description": "witch",
                        "target_lang_word": "heks",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heks",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c7bf53d-37e4-3028-8558-7284e4c72715",
                                        "entry_id": "cd8e5f05-86cb-3657-8787-0b80d87371ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een over het algemeen vrouwelijk persoon aan wie bovennatuurlijke krachten worden toegeschreven"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "person"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a21d29cf-382f-46d9-8450-64166a7d18dc",
                                                "sense_id": "7c7bf53d-37e4-3028-8558-7284e4c72715",
                                                "text": "In de middeleeuwen werd er in heksen geloofd."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99665488-bd50-4424-9117-0e1340e571db",
                                                "sense_id": "7c7bf53d-37e4-3028-8558-7284e4c72715",
                                                "text": "„Sinterklaas”, zei het nieuwe Pietje, „in een hol, hoog in de bergen, woont een heks die toverdranken maakt. Zal ik u de weg wijzen?”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa939f32-9ff9-32ef-9bd5-066136d751eb",
                                        "entry_id": "cd8e5f05-86cb-3657-8787-0b80d87371ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "boosaardige tovenares in sprookjes en mythen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative",
                                            "person"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd5c2432-a3a2-4b75-a3d0-52369309a5db",
                                                "sense_id": "fa939f32-9ff9-32ef-9bd5-066136d751eb",
                                                "text": "De boze heks sloot Hans op in het hok van het pannenkoekenhuisje"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a389ffa1-2bc1-368c-b57c-6dff4cea3ac0",
                                        "entry_id": "cd8e5f05-86cb-3657-8787-0b80d87371ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "onaangename, lastige vrouw"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative",
                                            "person"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0332a48-4169-4e81-8e80-3e4e76ea9c43",
                                                "sense_id": "a389ffa1-2bc1-368c-b57c-6dff4cea3ac0",
                                                "text": "wat is dat een heks geworden zeg!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
